tyle of play!\n\n\u25a0 Vessk is a VR game and SNS that aims to become a space like below:\n\u30fb Everyone can play for a long time.\n\u30fb Follow other players and connect with them in a loose way.\n\u30fb You have your own space and you don't have to stress.\n\u30fb And above all, you can be absorbed in playing.\n", "short_description": "Touch, scratch and tap your desk to control games!\nA casual gaming hub that lets you experience the game with your bare hands!\nFeatures:\n\u2605 Take full advantage of hand tracking!\n\u2605 MR experience!\n\u2605 Free of charge! \uff08Basic free!)\n\u2605 In-game rankings, achievements and following others!\n\u2605 No controller required (if the battery runs out, no matter!)\n\u2605 Multiple fun and easy-to-play games! (Whack an animal, Ball panic in tube)\n\u2605 More games will be added in the near future!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vessk.co.jp/en/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vessk.co.jp/en/terms-and-conditions/", "publisher_name": "Vessk Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://vessk.co.jp/en/support/", "website_url": "https://vessk.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "539527055410505"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "CASUAL", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3172993803024682"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "50575243